[00:07.72]Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:13.34]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:19.86]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:26.76]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:34.26]By his love God made provision;
[00:39.90]We may freely take his hand.
[00:46.26]So we make our dedication;
[00:52.24]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[00:58.34]In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:03.91]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:11.70]We are faced with opposition
[01:17.76]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:25.32]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:31.28]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:37.30]That we might forever serve him.
[01:43.24]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:54.02]Help for us God has provided
[01:59.72]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:06.22]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:13.26]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:20.84]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:26.68]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:32.76]He will help us to be loyal
[02:38.26]And walk modestly in his sight.
